      "text": "\n\nSubject: Update on your export request\n\nHi [Name],\n\nI am writing to let you know that the export feature you requested will be available one week later than originally scheduled.\n\nDuring our final validation process, we identified a data-integrity issue that could have caused some records to be incomplete or inaccurate in the exported file. We decided to pause the release to ensure that the data you receive is correct.\n\n**What is being done**\nOur engineering team is currently fixing the issue and re-running our full validation suite to confirm that all data points are accurate and complete.\n\n**What to expect next**\nWe expect to have the feature ready for release by [Date, one week from now]. We will send a separate email to confirm the launch once it is live.\n\n**Urgent cases**\nIf you have a time-sensitive need for this data before then, please reply directly to this email or contact our support team. We can manually generate the export for you to ensure you have the information you need without delay.\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your patience while we ensure the quality of this feature.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Title]",
