      "text": "\n\n# Release Plan: New Authentication Flow (v2)\n\n**Owner:** Platform/Auth team\n**Status:** Draft \u2014 pending security review sign-off\n**Target date:** TBD (gated on security review + load test)\n**Affected services:** `auth-service`, `session-service`, `api-gateway`, `web-client`, `mobile-sdk`\n\n---\n\n## 1. Scope\n\nReplace the legacy token-based auth (v1: opaque bearer tokens, 24h TTL, no refresh) with the new flow (v2: short-lived access tokens + rotating refresh tokens, PKCE for OAuth2, session revocation support).\n\n**In scope:**\n- New token issuance/refresh endpoints\n- Session revocation API\n- Client SDK updates (web + mobile)\n- Migration path for existing v1 sessions\n- Feature flag wiring\n\n**Out of scope:**\n- SSO/IdP integration changes (separate project)\n- MFA enrollment UX (follow-up release)\n- Legacy API v0 endpoints (deprecated, no changes)\n\n---\n\n## 2. Security Review\n\n**Must complete before any staging deploy.**\n\n| Item | Owner | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| Threat model for new token lifecycle | Security Eng | \u2610 |\n| Review of refresh token rotation logic (replay, theft) | Security Eng | \u2610 |\n| PKCE implementation audit (S256 only, no plain) | Security Eng | \u2610 |\n| Session revocation: confirm no TOCTOU in `session-service` | Security Eng | \u2610 |\n| Token storage in client SDKs (keychain/secure storage, no plaintext) | Security Eng | \u2610 |\n| Rate limiting on `/auth/refresh` (brute-force) | Security Eng | \u2610 |\n| Audit log: all token issuance/revocation events emitted | Security Eng | \u2610 |\n| Pen test on staging (target: 2 weeks before GA) | Security Eng | \u2610 |\n\n**Gate:** No staging deploy until Security Eng signs off on threat model + PKCE audit. No GA until pen test is clean (or findings are accepted with documented risk).\n\n---\n\n## 3. Feature Flags\n\nAll new behavior is behind flags. No code path is live without a flag check.\n\n| Flag | Scope | Default | Purpose |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `auth.v",
